  "notes": [
    "All new evidence is v2-only and diagnostic-only.",
    "The canonical benchmark directory and source seed are read-only study inputs.",
    "No raw student-identifying data belongs in this manifest.",
    "The historical e147 branch must not be reconstructed or replaced by another branch.",
    "The supervised target-scale cells were run one at a time with an explicit 1,800-second hard wall and a 1,024 MiB study-specific available-memory floor. A complete validated adaptive-derived branch was produced and revalidated by the parent after worker termination; the branch is detached from the canonical benchmark.",
    "Three additional 300-second qualification runs retained bounded worker phase history. They observed repeated CP-SAT attempts and full-model validation but no adopted strict improvement; no immediate worker branch artifact was therefore available for derived comparisons.",
    "An independent student_repair_r8_only control completed 46 observed targeted_r8_s2 attempts before the 1,800-second hard wall. Its final observed neighborhood probes were infeasible, but no policy payload or adopted branch was returned; this remains bounded operational evidence, not a global infeasibility proof.",
    "The derived adaptive, stateless-role, and fixed-cycle cells all retained the complete 37,128 branch without an authoritative returned improvement before the hard wall. Immediate worker persistence in the clean adaptive and stateless repeats additionally produced complete validated branches at 37,116 and 37,098; fixed-cycle and stateless-role repeats were resource-guard terminated during transient memory dips at 1,610.97 and 1,133.89 seconds respectively. A clean R2 follow-on retry from the 37,128 branch completed six observed attempts across the 3,600-second wall without improvement; its earlier attempt was resource-guard terminated and retried after memory recovered. A separate R2 follow-on from the stronger 37,098 stateless branch was resource-guard terminated at 1,905.04 seconds during CP-SAT when available memory fell below the 1 GiB floor and found no improvement. The study remains inconclusive for policy promotion, but now has bounded downstream-R2 and repeatability evidence showing that derived-state adaptive and stateless execution can produce further section-utilization improvements.",
    "The fresh matched baseline adaptive cell completed at 37,584 with two adopted complete/full-model-validated improvements; the fresh matched stateless-role cell completed at 37,248 with ten adopted complete/full-model-validated improvements. Both used the frozen 1,800-second policy budget, eight workers, immediate branch persistence, and canonical source-fingerprint lineage. The protocol-clean fixed-cycle rerun was sleep-contaminated and hard-deadline terminated during finalization without a candidate. A prior completed fixed-cycle run reached 37,302 with a valid branch, but its result payload was generated before the canonical-fingerprint protocol correction and is retained as excluded legacy metadata evidence rather than as the clean matched reference.",
    "Current supervised closeout evidence: the clean fixed-cycle baseline reached 37,386 from 37,596 after two adopted improvements; the matched 37,128-derived adaptive and stateless-role trials retained 37,128 without an adopted candidate; the matched fixed-cycle trial reached 36,912 after three adopted improvements and produced a parent-revalidated branch; and a 3,600-second R2 follow-on from that branch retained 36,912 after 23 unresolved UNKNOWN probes. These results are complete, full-model-validated, detached diagnostic evidence. They show state-dependent operator behavior but do not establish a universal production policy winner or an R2 local optimum. The study remains inconclusive for policy promotion; the next research boundary is the separately planned normalized Objective Semantics v2/0-10 importance study."
  ]
